<title>USA: Intimate Brands Aug same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Intimate Brands Aug same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 199	Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $191.9     $169.5	 +13   +2</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>NOTE: Same-store sales increase is on a fiscal year basis. The company's comparable store sales for the four weeks increased four percent on a calendar year basis.</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-to-date figures were not provided.</p>
<p>Month is four weeks ended Aug. 31.</p>
<p>Full company name is Intimate Brands, Inc.</p>
